Package: jarvis-installer-backend
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: dbus, polkitd, jarvis-ollama (= @VERSION@), jarvis-models-catalog (= @VERSION@), gdisk, cryptsetup, e2fsprogs, dosfstools, ntfs-3g, squashfs-tools, util-linux, efibootmgr, os-prober, grub-efi-amd64-signed, shim-signed
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ installer backend (system D-Bus os.jarvis.Installer1)
 Probes disks, plans and runs the install as root. Live session only.
